\end{figure}
   By the definition of $\kappa(\lambda)$ it thus suffices to prove that 
\begin{figure}[H]
    \includegraphics[width=2.7cm]{cointegrals_acting_on_X-1.pdf}
\end{figure}

To prove this, first note that:
    \begin{figure}[H]
